{"id":1110202,"name":"시나바·심문 II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"시나바·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1110202]}],"trial":{"trial_id":110202,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"","diary1":"시나바는 역시 신성 고위층들이 한때 가장 선호했던 보안 요원이었다. 요 며칠간의 강연 활동에서 팀은 그녀 덕분에 많은 위험을 피할 수 있었다.\n　　오늘은 강연 마지막 날이다. 아직까지 공격 의도를 가진 사람이 나타나진 않았으나, 긴장을 늦춰서는 안 된다.","diary2":"일이 이런 식으로 마무리될 줄은 아무도 생각지 못했다. 현장에서 부상자가 소수 발생했지만, 테러범은 무사히 붙잡혔다. 하지만 시나바와 스네이크 아이즈의 결별은 여전히 석연치가 않다.\n　　어쩌면 당신이 어떤 조치를 취해야 했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260151,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260152,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":3,"dialogue_id":210202005,"next":[6]},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210202023,"next":null},{"step"